//==============================================================================
// ACM3 MOSFET Compact Model - Version 3.0.0
// Advanced Compact MOSFET model, third generation: one module (acm3_va) for
// NMOS and PMOS. Parameters, IHP SG13G2 cards and examples:
// https://github.com/ACMmodel/ACM-MOSFET-models
//
// type = +1 : NMOS   |   type = -1 : PMOS
//
// Copyright (c) 2026, Universidade Federal de Santa Catarina (UFSC) and
//                     Universite Grenoble Alpes (UGA)
// Licensed under the Educational Community License, Version 2.0 (ECL-2.0)
//
// Developer:   Deni Germano Alves Neto (Doctoral student, UFSC and UGA)
//
// Supervisors: Prof. Carlos Galup-Montoro
//              Prof. Marcio Cherem Schneider
//              Prof. Sylvain Bourdel
//              Dr.   Manuel J. Barragan
